{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 1350,
 "dur": 45.0,
 "target": 45.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Felix's wedding cake swung across the sky like a wrecking ball.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.375
  },
  {
   "text": "Four tiers, nine hundred dollars, and the bride was watching from below.",
   "s": 3.575,
   "e": 6.941
  },
  {
   "text": "That morning, Felix had found a hole in the top of his parachute.",
   "s": 7.141,
   "e": 10.0
  },
  {
   "text": "\"A hole is a leak!\" he said, and patched it with a pizza box.",
   "s": 10.2,
   "e": 12.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Pudding the pig, promised the top tier, licked her lips.",
   "s": 13.08,
   "e": 15.494
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the chute opened. The cake swung left, then right, then upside down.",
   "s": 15.694,
   "e": 18.804
  },
  {
   "text": "So Felix tried a parachute twice as big. \"A hole is a leak!\"",
   "s": 19.004,
   "e": 22.222
  },
  {
   "text": "It swung twice as far, popped the bouncy castle, and took the groom's hat.",
   "s": 22.342,
   "e": 25.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Pudding chased the hat. The groom chased Pudding.",
   "s": 26.02,
   "e": 28.164
  },
  {
   "text": "Why did it swing?",
   "s": 28.364,
   "e": 29.074
  },
  {
   "text": "Air trapped under a closed chute has to escape, so it spills out one side.",
   "s": 29.374,
   "e": 33.177
  },
  {
   "text": "That shoves it the other way. Then it spills the other side. Tick, tock.",
   "s": 33.577,
   "e": 36.73
  },
  {
   "text": "A hole in the top lets the air out the middle, so it falls straight.",
   "s": 36.93,
   "e": 39.752
  },
  {
   "text": "The cake landed on Pudding, top tier first. Best day of her life.",
   "s": 39.952,
   "e": 43.152
  }
 ],
